    {
      "id": "eUB5l-m04soaspuulgwp4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 38.33332061767578,
      "y": 2752.5,
      "width": 860,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2R",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1392454892,
      "version": 139,
      "versionNonce": 641217900,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792064643784,
      "created": 1792060955227,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "每步：\n\n- 从 Ads 取 a[8]（蓝竖条：8 行 × 1 列）\n- 从 Bds 取 b[8]（绿横条：1 行 × 8 列）\n- 外积：val[i][j] += a[i] * b[j]，结果累加到紫色方块 val [8][8]\n\n重复 BK=32 次，val 就是最终 C 小块。\n\n核心账： 每步只加载 16 个数（a [8]+b [8]），做 64 次乘加。a、b 各在寄存器里复用 8 次。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "每步：\n\n- 从 Ads 取 a[8]（蓝竖条：8 行 × 1 列）\n- 从 Bds 取 b[8]（绿横条：1 行 × 8 列）\n- 外积：val[i][j] += a[i] * b[j]，结果累加到紫色方块 val [8][8]\n\n重复 BK=32 次，val 就是最终 C 小块。\n\n核心账： 每步只加载 16 个数（a [8]+b [8]），做 64 次乘加。a、b 各在寄存器里复用 8 次。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "-OQNXTzea3i8CJDxqEGE2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 35,
      "y": 2700.8334350585938,
      "width": 168,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2S",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1620102124,
      "version": 96,
      "versionNonce": 670638164,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792064651438,
      "created": 1792061132905,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "寄存器内外积",
